  "notes": "Asked for in the Simulacrum with AI paused, one enemy at a time, at its body from about 5 m, with Arca Plasmor, and no numbers were predicted to Pavel. The hits are counted until the shield is gone, so all but the last of them were not enough. Loadout A has no mods. The report's rows at level 150 wait for a second run: its two runs don't agree with one another, and shields may have grown back during a reload. The two numbers of the shot that broke the shield wait for ABA-22: 5% of what was left of it reached health, and the shield's number shows all the rest of it. Arca Plasmor is in the fixture for the reason in T-27.",
